# The longest list row the game can produce: "Simplify - Knight vs Bishop" against the computer, in the Load screen and in the game's Save
# panel. The title is cut with "..." at its normal size and the turns / date stay whole at the right; every row is left-aligned.
# Layout (1400x800): main menu Load game (150,310); the first slot row (600,166); in the game Save (72,77).
wait 20
slot 1 ../records/vs-long-title.5dr
slot 2 ../records/vs-white-easy.5dr
click 150 310        # Load game
wait 40
capture layout-load-long-labels
click 600 166        # slot 1
wait 120
click 72 77          # Save: the panel lists the three slots
wait 30
capture layout-save-long-labels
